      "updated": 0,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Step: GetPartNumber (DataCollectionSteps=2)\n\n• PartNumber control (implements IDataCollectionControl)\n• Accepts typed or scanned input\n• cbIsProductMonitoringUnit checkbox:\n  - Visible only for certain part types\n  - Checked → IsProductMonitoringUnit = true\n  - Sets flag on UnitClaimingSkid model\n• On Next:\n  1. Save ModelNumber to current skid record\n  2. If Combo skid & index 0 → switch to skid 2\n  3. Validate dup model numbers in combo\n  4. Advance to GetSerialNumber\n• Previous button ENABLED (back to EmployeeBadge)\n\nPartNumber control swaps into panel1 via PrepareForm()",
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Step: GetPartNumber (DataCollectionSteps=2)\n\n• PartNumber control (implements IDataCollectionControl)\n• Accepts typed or scanned input\n• cbIsProductMonitoringUnit checkbox:\n  - Visible only for certain part types\n  - Checked → IsProductMonitoringUnit = true\n  - Sets flag on UnitClaimingSkid model\n• On Next:\n  1. Save ModelNumber to current skid record\n  2. If Combo skid & index 0 → switch to skid 2\n  3. Validate dup model numbers in combo\n  4. Advance to GetSerialNumber\n• Previous button ENABLED (back to EmployeeBadge)\n\nPartNumber control swaps into panel1 via PrepareForm()",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.4
    },
    {
      "id": "annotation-combo",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 455,
      "y": 350,
      "width": 433,
      "height": 80,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#f59e0b",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1021,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1021,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 0,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Combo Skid variation:\n• Two UnitClaimingSkid records in model\n• ComboSkidActiveSkidIndex tracks which half (0 or 1)\n• After first part number + qty → index=1, re-show PartNumber\n• Duplicate model number validation on both halves\n• Previous disabled when on skid 1 qty & coming from PartNumber",
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Combo Skid variation:\n• Two UnitClaimingSkid records in model\n• ComboSkidActiveSkidIndex tracks which half (0 or 1)\n• After first part number + qty → index=1, re-show PartNumber\n• Duplicate model number validation on both halves\n• Previous disabled when on skid 1 qty & coming from PartNumber",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.4
    },
    {
      "id": "annotation-nav",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 455,
      "y": 445,
      "width": 433,
      "height": 60,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#22c55e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
